Boxer Lovers Rescue is committed to assisting shelters with the boxers in their care and providing options to owners no longer able to care for their boxer. 

Our mission is to provide proper nourishment, medical care, socialization and behavioral training to homeless and unwanted boxers; 
provide education on the boxer breed; 

and rehome the boxer with caring and responsible families, where the boxer will thrive as a loving and loyal family member.
